# Ladybug Clock

## Section

Ladybug clock which is the first puzzle at https://momath.org/mindbenders/
if a ladybug starts at 12 on a clock and jumps randomly to the nearest
number, what are the odds that the last digit it lands on is 6?

```elixir
# When inspecting lists of numbers, use "charlists: :as_lists"
#
Mix.install([
  # Join the string so a copy of dayN to dayM doesn't destroy it.
  {:kino, "~> 0.1" <> "4.2"}
])

# Join the string so a copy of dayN to dayM doesn't destroy it.
